    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一日は足どめされそうな大検問だ。
これは約束の日までに
エストレーガにつくのは無理だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Looks like they're in the middle of a big inspection that would hold us up for a whole day. Sorry, sweetie but we won't be making it to Estraga on time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え〜、そんなのやだよぉ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whaat, no fair...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>検問を通らない方法はあるけど
すごく危険なんだ。
あきらめておくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There are ways around the inspection, but they're far too dangerous. Let's just give up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やだ、やだ、やだよぉ！
うぇ〜〜〜ん…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nooo, but I don't wanna! Waah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>検問にかからず
帝都に行く道があんのぉ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is there really a way to bypass the inspection?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『ドーズモアの森』を通れば。
でも、その森は、磁場が乱れて
方位を見失う迷いの森なんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's a path through Douze Mois Way. However, the forest is full of disorientating magnetic fields which make it impossible to navigate.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>キャラバンギルドには
通り抜けの方法が伝承されて
いるんですが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a little trick handed down through the caravan guild.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>近頃は、どう猛な魔物が増えて
私たちだけでは
とても通過できません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But recently, there's been more and more monsters, so its not safe for us to travel alone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>失礼ですが、あなた方は？
私はキャラバン商人のオーブ。
妻のシンディと娘のアンです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where are my manners, what about you all? I'm Obe, a caravan merchant. This here's my wife Cindy and Daughter An.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレは、&lt;Shing&gt;。
この先の帝国軍駐屯地から
逃げてきたん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My name's Shing. We're on the run from that military base trying to get the the capital-</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バカ正直に
ヤバイ事までペラペラ
しゃべんじゃねぇよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You idiot! Don't just go casually spilling the beans like that!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレたちも帝都に急いでるんだ。
道を教えてくれるなら護衛するよ。
教会の騎士より腕は確かだぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're on our way to the capital. We'd be happy to escort you if you'd show us the way. I can guarentee we're at least as strong as those Crystal Knights.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当ですか？　ぜひお願いします！
必要なものがあったら
言ってくださいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really? That would be fanstastic, thank you! Just let us know if need anything!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわぁ〜い！
ありがとう、おにいちゃんたち！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yaaay! Thank you sooo much!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では、ドーズモアの森に
出発しましょう。
準備はいいですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's head for Douze Mois Way. Ready to depart?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『器』と思われる
起動詩詠唱者の捕捉に失敗。
思念反応探索————</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Failed to apprehend individual suspected to be the vessel. Scanning for Will signatures-</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>機能障害……
やはり前回の戦闘で思念探知機能は
完全に破壊されたか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A malfunction has occured... it appears Will detection functions have been destoyed in previous battle.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これでは『主』——そして
『ヤツ』の位置も特定できない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Unable to pinpoint location of my Master... or "him".</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>追跡目標を
『器』の関係者と推定される
一行へと変更する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Changing directive to pursue the suspected vessel.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
